### 环境切换（默认使用 dev）
GET {{base_url}}/actuator/health


### 查询所有图书
GET {{base_url}}/api/books
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 查询单本图书（id=1）
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 创建图书（POST）
POST {{base_url}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "title": "Spring Security 实战",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 69.00,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 更新图书（PUT /{id}）
PUT {{base_url}}/api/books/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

{
  "title": "Spring Security 实战（第2版）",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 79.00,
  "stock": 12,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 删除图书（DELETE /{id}）
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/books/1
Authorization: Bearer 123456


### 分页查询
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/page?pageNum=2&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 分页查询：支持作者和分类
GET {{base_url}}/api/books/search/page?pageNum=2&pageSize=5&author=Craig Walls&category=技术
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456